<mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Cannot find version 16.6&lt;/b&gt; → Aurora 버전 올림&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;VPN client token 충돌&lt;/b&gt; → VPN 스택 삭제 후 재배포&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ROLLBACK_COMPLETE&lt;/b&gt; → 스택 삭제 후 재배포" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="381" width="660" height="96" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
